{"name":"Fighter Jet","hex":"#939498","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fighter jet","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Synonym of jet fighter."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fighter_jet"}],"entries":[{"title":"Fighter aircraft","blocks":[{"text":"Fighter aircraft are military aircraft designed primarily for air-to-air combat. In military conflict, the role of fighter aircraft is to establish air superiority of the battlespace. Domination of the airspace above a battlefield permits bombers and attack aircraft to engage in tactical and strategic bombing of enemy targets, and helps prevent the enemy from doing the same."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Formation_of_a_Legacy%2C_Heritage_flight_merges_aviation_past_and_present_86-16-51-22.jpg/330px-Formation_of_a_Legacy%2C_Heritage_flight_merges_aviation_past_and_present_86-16-51-22.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fighter_aircraft","wikidata":"Q127771"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/Airco_D.H.2_ExCC.jpg/500px-Airco_D.H.2_ExCC.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/Airco_D.H.2_ExCC.jpg/500px-Airco_D.H.2_ExCC.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Airco DH.2 \"pusher\" scout","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAirco_D.H.2_ExCC.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/F-35A_flight_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-F-35A_flight_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/F-35A_flight_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-F-35A_flight_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.w